{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator&quot; is a delightful simulation game where you build a farm, grow organic products, feed your animals, and expand your business by selling your products in your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745244018\" /><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745244018\" /><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/gif4.gif?t=1745244018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/gif6.gif?t=1745244018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/gif5.gif?t=1745244018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745244018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farm Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think your farm is too small? Then expand it further. Open more farmland, purchase new machines, and increase animal diversity to grow your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator&quot; will show you how enjoyable managing both a farm and a supermarket can be. Set your strategy, grow step by step, and achieve success. Enjoy this detailed and delightful gaming experience and become the owner of a large farm and supermarket chain!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070880/9483d164e5dbc68665f7b8dfe57f9366c105ebdc.jpg"},{"name":"Good job !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070880/db6807f0e19378b0f63ec96dc027a12e1d6dc6a1.jpg"},{"name":"Yes ! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070880/da1b92f8b6bab9aba6ce3cbe1d8c1d05d9688d4c.jpg"},{"name":"Amazing !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3070880/10777413a57cc820f3deae529c026d79a6547c1a.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3070880?t=1745244018","background_raw":"https://shared.akama